@baseUrl = http://localhost:5146

# @name loginSara
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "sara@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

###
@saraToken = {{loginSara.response.body.token}}

# @name loginAli
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

###
@aliToken = {{loginAli.response.body.token}}

### 1. Default (page 1, 10 items, newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 2. Small pages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?page=1&pageSize=2
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 3. Page 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?page=2&pageSize=2
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 4. Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=Open
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 5. Filter by priority
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?priority=High
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 6. Search (try different capitalisation too)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?search=laptop
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 7. Sort by priority, most severe first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sortBy=priority&sortDir=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 8. Sort by due date, soonest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?sortBy=dueAt&sortDir=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 9. Agent queue: unassigned tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?unassigned=true&status=Open
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 10. Combined
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=Open&priority=High&search=outlook&sortBy=dueAt&page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 11. Ali still only sees his own tickets, whatever he filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{aliToken}}

### 12. Bad page size (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?pageSize=1000
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### 13. Bad enum value (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=Banana
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}